prime_server
------------------------------------------
Non-blocking (web)server API for distributed computing and SOA based on zeromq

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libcurl4-8.23.0-1
  libczmq-devel-4.2.1-1bl2
  libczmq4-4.2.1-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libprime_server-devel-0.13.1-1bl1
  libprime_server0-0.13.1-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libzmq-devel-4.3.5-1
  libzmq5-4.3.5-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libczmq-devel-4.2.1-1bl2
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libzmq-devel-4.3.5-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/kevinkreiser/prime_server

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/kevinkreiser/prime_server/archive/0.13.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack prime_server-0.13.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./prime_server-0.13.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/prime_server-0.13.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/prime_server-0.13.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libprime_server0-0.13.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libprime_server-devel-0.13.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(prime_server)
  /usr/bin/prime_echod.exe
  /usr/bin/prime_filed.exe
  /usr/bin/prime_httpd.exe
  /usr/bin/prime_proxyd.exe
  /usr/bin/prime_serverd.exe
  /usr/bin/prime_workerd.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/prime_server.README
  /usr/share/doc/prime_server/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/prime_server/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/prime_server/LICENSE.md
  /usr/share/doc/prime_server/README
  /usr/share/doc/prime_server/README.md

(libprime_server0)
  /usr/bin/cygprime_server-0.dll

(libprime_server-devel)
  /usr/include/prime_server/http_protocol.hpp
  /usr/include/prime_server/http_util.hpp
  /usr/include/prime_server/netstring_protocol.hpp
  /usr/include/prime_server/prime_server.hpp
  /usr/include/prime_server/zmq_helpers.hpp
  /usr/lib/libprime_server.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libprime_server.pc

